      "note": "The record identifies bases for each major conclusion: reasonable accommodation denials cite operational needs and job function requirements; leave denials cite leave balance exhaustion and coverage conflicts; harassment claims are grounded in specific incidents (C1 comments, S1A statements, exclusion from meetings) with dates and quoted language."
